  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  comment: 'Any collider shape will work with the Trigger Sensor, or even combinations
    of colliders. Whatever will make it receive those ''OnTriggerEnter'' and ''OnTriggerExit''
    events. This is one reason its so versatile.


    I''m using here the including
    FOV Collider component to detect objects within a cone of vision.'
